<DemoExample Title="Submenu" RazorCode="@example18RazorCode" CsharpCode="@example18CsharpCode" Id="example18"
             PreventRenderForMcpClient>
    <div>
        An item with ChildItems opens a submenu beside it instead of raising a click of its own. The pointer
        opens it on hover, the keyboard with ArrowRight, and ArrowLeft or Escape walks back out one level.
